{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /CAMINHO/opencode-precost/adapters/claude-code/track-model.js"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostModelSwitch": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /CAMINHO/opencode-precost/adapters/claude-code/track-model.js"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node /CAMINHO/opencode-precost/adapters/claude-code/userpromptsubmit.js",
            "timeout": 20,
            "onFailure": "continue"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "deny": [
      "Read(~/.cache/precost/**)",
      "Edit(~/.cache/precost/**)",
      "Write(~/.cache/precost/**)"
    ]
  },
  "_comment": "permissions.deny: reduz a chance do modelo ler/escrever o estado de aprovacao via ferramentas de arquivo; NAO testado em Claude Code real e NAO impede Bash (ver docs/CAPACIDADES.md, limite de seguranca)."
}